Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: protect retained disks before instance deletion

Read the complete attached-disk inventory before each deletion attempt and
reject unsafe retention settings or security operation locks. Apply the
same profile in the adaptor and independent PeerPod controller so either
cleanup path preserves persistent data disks.

This profile supports retained-volume deployments. It builds on the
independent deletion-absence fix without changing its error semantics.

